@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC09 — Configure site or course author policy
actor "Policy manager" as Manager
participant "Moodle settings / course page" as UI
participant author_policy as Policy
database "Site / course policy" as DB
Manager -> UI : Open effective policy
UI -> Policy : locked(courseid)
Policy -> DB : Read site / course rule
Policy --> UI : Effective state
Manager -> UI : Choose permitted course value
UI -> Policy : save(courseid, policy)
Policy -> Policy : Check capability / tighten-only rule
Policy -> DB : Store override revision / actor
Policy --> UI : Confirmation
@enduml
